{"id":"97a794aef4eec69f","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma.md","title":"thm-leftover-hash-lemma","display":"thm-leftover-hash-lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma","aliases":["28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma"],"display":"thm-leftover-hash-lemma","depends_on":["[[28-df-min-entropy]]","[[28-df-pairwise-independent-family]]","[[28-df-statistical-distance]]"],"source_book_location":"Lemma 21.26 and its collision-probability proof; printed pp.445–446; PDF pp.471–472","source_printed_pages":"445–446","source_pdf_pages":"471–472","source_status":"statement-checked","proof_status":"local-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-leftover-hash-lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f79df9244d067310\" href=\"?note=f79df9244d067310\" title=\"28-df-min-entropy\">28-df-min-entropy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d828bbffc0f86990\" href=\"?note=d828bbffc0f86990\" title=\"28-df-pairwise-independent-family\">28-df-pairwise-independent-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"09af003dd1fefc1b\" href=\"?note=09af003dd1fefc1b\" title=\"28-df-statistical-distance\">28-df-statistical-distance</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma 21.26 and its collision-probability proof; printed pp.445–446; PDF pp.471–472"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"445–446"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"471–472"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in[0,n]\">\\(k\\in[0,n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f79df9244d067310\" href=\"?note=f79df9244d067310\" title=\"28-df-min-entropy\">28-df-min-entropy</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq(\\{0,1\\}^m)^{\\{0,1\\}^n}\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq(\\{0,1\\}^m)^{\\{0,1\\}^n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;\\{0,1\\}^n,\\{0,1\\}^m)\">\\(\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;\\{0,1\\}^n,\\{0,1\\}^m)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d828bbffc0f86990\" href=\"?note=d828bbffc0f86990\" title=\"28-df-pairwise-independent-family\">28-df-pairwise-independent-family</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}\">\\(H\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_m\">\\(U_m\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 相互独立；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"09af003dd1fefc1b\" href=\"?note=09af003dd1fefc1b\" title=\"28-df-statistical-distance\">28-df-statistical-distance</a>。联合分布以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(h,y)\\in\\mathcal H\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\">\\((h,y)\\in\\mathcal H\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\)</span> 为共同论域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\bigl((H,H(X)),(H,U_m)\\bigr)\\le\\frac12\\sqrt{2^{m-k}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\bigl((H,H(X)),(H,U_m)\\bigr)\\le\\frac12\\sqrt{2^{m-k}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\epsilon\\in(0,1]\\;\\left(m\\le k-2\\log_2(1/\\epsilon)\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\bigl((H,H(X)),(H,U_m)\\bigr)\\le\\epsilon/2\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\epsilon\\in(0,1]\\;\\left(m\\le k-2\\log_2(1/\\epsilon)\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\bigl((H,H(X)),(H,U_m)\\bigr)\\le\\epsilon/2\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是引理 21.26 的带种子联合分布形式，并给出其证明隐含的标准显式距离界。原书陈述中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\\circ H\">\\(U_n\\circ H\\)</span> 的维数与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H(X)\">\\(H(X)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 位不符；按证明的共同输出论域应为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_m\\circ H\">\\(U_m\\circ H\\)</span>，此处修正并明确记录。</p>\n<p>本地完整推导：令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_x=\\Pr[X=x]\">\\(p_x=\\Pr[X=x]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_X=\\sum_xp_x^2\\le2^{-k}\">\\(c_X=\\sum_xp_x^2\\le2^{-k}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(h,y)=\\Pr[H=h,H(X)=y]\">\\(q(h,y)=\\Pr[H=h,H(X)=y]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=|\\mathcal H|2^m\">\\(N=|\\mathcal H|2^m\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(H&#39;,X&#39;)\">\\((H&#39;,X&#39;)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(H,X)\">\\((H,X)\\)</span> 的独立副本。联合输出碰撞要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=H&#39;\">\\(H=H&#39;\\)</span>，条件于此，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=X&#39;\">\\(X=X&#39;\\)</span> 的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_X\">\\(c_X\\)</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\ne X&#39;\">\\(X\\ne X&#39;\\)</span> 时，两两独立的散列输出碰撞概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-m}\">\\(2^{-m}\\)</span>。故\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{h,y}q(h,y)^2=|\\mathcal H|^{-1}(c_X+(1-c_X)2^{-m})\">\\(\\sum_{h,y}q(h,y)^2=|\\mathcal H|^{-1}(c_X+(1-c_X)2^{-m})\\)</span>。\n目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(H,U_m)\">\\((H,U_m)\\)</span> 在共同论域上均匀，质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/N\">\\(1/N\\)</span>，于是\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{h,y}(q(h,y)-1/N)^2=\\sum q(h,y)^2-1/N=|\\mathcal H|^{-1}(1-2^{-m})c_X\\le|\\mathcal H|^{-1}2^{-k}\">\\(\\sum_{h,y}(q(h,y)-1/N)^2=\\sum q(h,y)^2-1/N=|\\mathcal H|^{-1}(1-2^{-m})c_X\\le|\\mathcal H|^{-1}2^{-k}\\)</span>。\n由 Cauchy–Schwarz，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\le\\tfrac12\\sqrt N\\sqrt{|\\mathcal H|^{-1}2^{-k}}=\\tfrac12\\sqrt{2^{m-k}}\">\\(\\Delta\\le\\tfrac12\\sqrt N\\sqrt{|\\mathcal H|^{-1}2^{-k}}=\\tfrac12\\sqrt{2^{m-k}}\\)</span>。\n代入第二式的长度条件得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon/2\">\\(\\epsilon/2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 时输出常为空串，联合分布恰为目标；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时定义域单点，由本地两两独立定义的边缘均匀条款仍得到有效界。以上仅升级本条完整本地碰撞证明的核验状态；原书印刷445–446页的输出维数及中间指数存在排印问题，按此独立逐式推导校正，没有声称审计整章证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-min-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"f79df9244d067310","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-min-entropy]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pairwise-independent-family","status":"resolved","id":"d828bbffc0f86990","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pairwise-independent-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-statistical-distance","status":"resolved","id":"09af003dd1fefc1b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-statistical-distance]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-min-entropy","status":"resolved","id":"f79df9244d067310","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in[0,n]$；$X\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}$，见 [[28-df-min-entropy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pairwise-independent-family","status":"resolved","id":"d828bbffc0f86990","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq(\\{0,1\\}^m)^{\\{0,1\\}^n}$ 且 $\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;\\{0,1\\}^n,\\{0,1\\}^m)$，见 [[28-df-pairwise-independent-family]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-statistical-distance","status":"resolved","id":"09af003dd1fefc1b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}$、$U_m$ 与 $X$ 相互独立；$\\Delta$ 见 [[28-df-statistical-distance]]。联合分布以 $(h,y)\\in\\mathcal H\\times\\{0,1\\}^m$ 为共同论域。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in[0,n]","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Source}_{n,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal H\\subseteq(\\{0,1\\}^m)^{\\{0,1\\}^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PairInd}(\\mathcal H;\\{0,1\\}^n,\\{0,1\\}^m)","display":false},{"tex":"H\\leftarrow U_{\\mathcal H}","display":false},{"tex":"U_m","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"(h,y)\\in\\mathcal H\\times\\{0,1\\}^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\bigl((H,H(X)),(H,U_m)\\bigr)\\le\\frac12\\sqrt{2^{m-k}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\epsilon\\in(0,1]\\;\\left(m\\le k-2\\log_2(1/\\epsilon)\\Rightarrow\\Delta\\bigl((H,H(X)),(H,U_m)\\bigr)\\le\\epsilon/2\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"U_n\\circ H","display":false},{"tex":"H(X)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"U_m\\circ H","display":false},{"tex":"p_x=\\Pr[X=x]","display":false},{"tex":"c_X=\\sum_xp_x^2\\le2^{-k}","display":false},{"tex":"q(h,y)=\\Pr[H=h,H(X)=y]","display":false},{"tex":"N=|\\mathcal H|2^m","display":false},{"tex":"(H',X')","display":false},{"tex":"(H,X)","display":false},{"tex":"H=H'","display":false},{"tex":"X=X'","display":false},{"tex":"c_X","display":false},{"tex":"X\\ne X'","display":false},{"tex":"2^{-m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{h,y}q(h,y)^2=|\\mathcal H|^{-1}(c_X+(1-c_X)2^{-m})","display":false},{"tex":"(H,U_m)","display":false},{"tex":"1/N","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{h,y}(q(h,y)-1/N)^2=\\sum q(h,y)^2-1/N=|\\mathcal H|^{-1}(1-2^{-m})c_X\\le|\\mathcal H|^{-1}2^{-k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\le\\tfrac12\\sqrt N\\sqrt{|\\mathcal H|^{-1}2^{-k}}=\\tfrac12\\sqrt{2^{m-k}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon/2","display":false},{"tex":"m=0","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false}],"bytes":2606,"backlinks":[{"id":"0c3cbeaaa31fd355","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"定义 21.24 不要求提取器高效计算；显式提取器另加算法条件。种子独立且均匀是必要前提。此处为普通提取器，保留种子后的联合分布结论另由 [[28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma]] 给出；该语义差异没有合并。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-227","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第21章：熵与提取器：[[28-df-min-entropy]]、[[28-df-randomness-extractor]]、[[28-thm-leftover-hash-lemma]]。"}],"outgoing":["f79df9244d067310","d828bbffc0f86990","09af003dd1fefc1b"]}